    <description>8/1/25 - Case#00016258 - added &quot;Need to Update Project Hours&quot; decision to cut down on when this process runs. Only needs to run when Est Hours, Client Rate, or Project on Assignment changes.
9/25/25 - Sawyer reported issues with Project field updates from Assignments. Added Additional condition to &quot;Need to Update Project&quot; decision to say or IsNew.
10/2/25 - Sawyer reported issues that Company Holiday create timecards was failing. Had to update Get PLI to Name equals &quot;Company Internal - Company Holiday&quot;
1/5/26 - Updated Project Name decision to reference Custom Label.</description>
